#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_element.rst:5
msgid "Delete element"
msgstr "删除元件"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_element.rst:7
msgid ""
"Working with collections can only be done from the collections panel. Before"
" starting to work with collections, the collections panel has to be "
"displayed."
msgstr "集合的相关操作只能在集合面板中进行。在开始使用集合之前，必须先显示集合面板。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_element.rst:12
msgid ""
"Select **Settings > Display > Collections** menu item to display the "
"Collections panel."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 集合** 菜单项以显示集合面板。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_element.rst:14
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows deleting element from some collection. The user has only"
" read rights at QET element collection, the user can delete element from all"
" collections except QET collection."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许从某个集合中删除元件。用户对 QET 元件集合只有读取权限，因此除了 QET 集合之外，用户可以从其他所有集合中删除元件。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_element.rst:17
msgid "Right click on the element which should de deleted."
msgstr "右键单击要删除的元件。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_element.rst:22
msgid "Figure: Options at element"
msgstr "图：元件上的选项"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_element.rst:24
msgid "Click the option **Delete element** to delete the element."
msgstr "单击 **删除元件** 选项以删除该元件。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_element.rst:28
msgid ""
"Be sure about you intention to delete, the element will be deleted from the "
"collection and and from the file system."
msgstr "请确认您确实要删除，该元件将从集合和文件系统中删除。"
